				{
					"id": 411420101,
					"content": "我這就送過去。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411420102
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 411420102,
					"content": "#那就麻煩{F#妳}{M#你}了，實在幫大忙了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411420103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卯師傅"
				},
				{
					"id": 411420103,
					"content": "拿好了，就是這份珍珠翡翠白玉湯，送的時候記得當心點，<color=#00E1FFFF>別被撞翻了，也千萬別用風之翼</color>，不然弄灑了都不知道。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411420104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卯師傅"
				},
				{
					"id": 411420104,
					"content": "還有就是，<color=#00E1FFFF>別沾了奇怪的東西</color>。不然可能串了味道…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411420105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卯師傅"
				},
				{
					"id": 411420105,
					"content": "好了，快點把這菜送過去吧，涼了就不好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "卯師傅"
				}
			]
